ral.\n\nAfter 1...Nxg3, White has two recaptures:\n- 2.hxg3: Pawn captures knight, opens h-file\n- 2.Kxg3: King captures knight, activates the king\n\nBetween these two, which is better for White?\n\nActually, I think 2.Kxg3 might be worse for White because it moves the king away from defending the h2 pawn. But let me just go with the main line I've been analyzing (2.hxg3).\n\nFinal answer:\n\n```json\n{\"move\": \"Nxg3\", \"line\": [\"Nxg3\", \"hxg3\", \"Rxd2\", \"Rxd2\"], \"motifs\": [\"sacrifice\", \"fork\"]}\n```\n\nDone!", "tool_calls": [{"tool": "skill", "args": {"skill": "chess-coach"}}, {"tool": "chess-eyes-board", "args": {"fen": "8/6p1/4p1k1/3pPn2/2pP4/2P3PK/1r1BR2P/8 b - - 0 51"}}, {"tool": "chess-eyes-threats", "args": {"fen": "8/6p1/4p1k1/3pPn2/2pP4/2P3PK/1r1BR2P/8 b - - 0 51"}}, {"tool": "chess-eyes-inspect_move", "args": {"fen": "8/6p1/4p1k1/3pPn2/2pP4/2P3PK/1r1BR2P/8 b - - 0 51", "move": "Rh2"}}, {"tool": "chess-eyes-inspect_move", "args": {"fen": "8/6p1/4p1k1/3pPn2/2pP4/2P3PK/1r1BR2P/8 b - - 0 51", "move": "Rb3"}}, {"tool": "chess-eyes-inspect_move", "args": {"fen": "8/6p1/4p1k1/3pPn2/2pP4/2P3PK/1r1BR2P/8 b - - 0 51", "move": "Nd4"}}, {"tool": "chess-eyes-inspect_move", "args": {"fen": "8/6p1/4p1k1/3pP3/2pn4/2P3PK/1r1BR2P/8 w - - 0 52", "move": "cxd4"}}, {"tool": "chess-eyes-inspect_move", "args": {"fen": "8/6p1/4p1k1/3pP3/2pp4/5PPK/1r1BR2P/8 b - - 0 52", "move": "Rxe2"}}, {"tool": "chess-eyes-inspect_move", "args": {"fen": "8/6p1/4p1k1/3pP3/2pn4/2P3PK/1r1BR2P/8 w - - 0 52", "move": "Rxd4"}}, {"tool": "chess-eyes-board", "args": {"fen": "8/6p1/4p1k1/3pPn2/2pP4/2P3PK/1r1BR2P/8 b - - 0 51"}}, {"tool": "chess-eyes-threats", "args": {"fen": "8/6p1/4p1k1/3pP3/2pn4/2P3PK/1r1BR2P/8 w - - 0 52"}}, {"tool": "chess-eyes-inspect_move", "args": {"fen": "8/6p1/4p1k1/3pP3/2pn4/2P3PK/1r1BR2P/8 w - - 0 52", "move": "cxd4"}}, {"tool": "chess-eyes-inspect_move", "args": {"fen": "8/6p1/4p1k1/3pPn2/2pP4/2P3PK/1r1BR2P/8 b - - 0 51", "move": "Ne3"}}, {"tool": "chess-eyes